    [Doc][Model] Sync Kimi-K3 guide from official v0.27 branch (#18834)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Synchronize `docs/source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md` on `main` from the
    official `vllm-project/vllm-ascend:releases/v0.27.1rc` guide at
    `0ce124446a0f59c431da76e31ffcc53489622513`.
    
    Source:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/0ce124446a0f59c431da76e31ffcc53489622513/docs/source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md
    
    Bring in the official PD connector configuration updates, pooled PD
    deployment instructions for MetaService/MemCache, and A3 LD_PRELOAD
    guidance and configuration updates.
    
    Preserve the reviewed 950DT Products naming, platform order of 950 then
    A3 then A2, model path placeholders, supported status, removal of
    experimental labeling, and existing PD reference-design/production note.
    Remove the unpinned latest-version statement. Keep the Docker output
    instructions unchanged.
    
    Fix the ordinary and pooled PD templates so all eight connector TP
    fields derive from `$7`, matching the engine and DSpark draft TP.
    Document the equal-TP requirement for Prefill and Decode. Merge Section
    5.3.6 into one shared launcher command with a role-specific placeholder
    table, retaining its A3 TP16 deployment scope.
    
    Related to #18520.
    
    Explicitly clear inherited `LD_PRELOAD` in both pooled PD engine
    templates (Section 5.3.5), matching the documented A3 jemalloc
    restriction and the ordinary PD templates.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Documentation only. Deployment examples now match the official v0.27.1rc
    guide.
    
